WEBVTT

00:04:58.738 --> 00:05:01.974
perhaps like a sheet of plastic wrapping.

00:05:03.045 --> 00:05:06.830
You may have wondered
why we brought a hula hoop onstage today.

00:05:07.838 --> 00:05:08.993
We'll show you.

00:05:11.466 --> 00:05:12.715
(Laughter)

00:05:15.096 --> 00:05:17.950
Now, it is very hard to hide

00:05:17.974 --> 00:05:20.397
that something has happened
to this hoop, right?

00:05:21.442 --> 00:05:24.644
It is different
before and after I punched it.

00:05:25.035 --> 00:05:27.010
The seal is broken,

00:05:27.586 --> 00:05:29.345
and unless we change the plastic,

00:05:29.369 --> 00:05:31.489
it won't get back to its intact state.